From a8a45106e14d88dc3a9367ce13135776cb4552ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 21:45:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add celebrating, dizzy, startled, listening and bored moods

Clawd now reacts to how a turn ends (confetti for an answer, dizzy for an
error or refusal, startled for an interruption), leans in and reads along
while you type, and gets bored after a configurable quiet spell. Awake
gains a wave and a stretch, vibing two more dance moves, sleeping snore
bubbles.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TUcekKvdxKpaSnZ3rFWJXZ
